        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-759, Round Floral Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Petals at Edge Cabinet Knob brings to mind the image of a flower but in a way that is not overly feminine. It is a great choice for traditional homes that want beautifully styled hardware. The Round Floral Cabinet Knob is available in 7 finishes including antique english, satin nickel, and oil rubbed bronze (pictured). It is available in 2 sizes: a 1-1/4 inch diameter and a 1-1/2 inch diameter.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/floral-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-862\"><b>Matching Floral Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-759 Floral Petals at Edge Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-759:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-758:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR50_size.gif?v=1704354712\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
